<title>UK: Societe Generale sets warrants on 10-year bund.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale sets warrants on 10-year bund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale said it has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the 6.0 pct German bund due January 2006.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JUL.97-30.APR.98   PAYDATE	29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, BERLIN   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  103.51</p>
<p>ONE BUND IS CONTROLLED BY 10 WARRANTS (1000 DEM NONINAL) * * * * * *</p>
<p>     TYPE	     STRIKE	ISSUE</p>
<p>SERIES I CALL	 108	   0.35 DEM</p>
<p>SERIES J CALL	 110	   0.16 DEM</p>
<p>SERIES K PUT	  94	    0.26 DEM</p>
<p>SERIES L PUT	  96	    0.55 DEM</p>
<p>NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   SGWAI5</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
